{6}{Joachim!}{}{5}{}{9}{}
{7}{Wa-Keem!}{}{-4}{}{9}{}
{9}{Yes.  It is I.  I must apologize...I have been so busy trying to find out who was trying to kill you and why, that I neglected to consider the fact that you might need my help in other matters.  But, you are alive and so I rejoice...}{Yes.  It is I.  I must apologize...I have been so busy trying to find out who was trying to kill you and why, that I neglected to consider the fact that you might need my help in other matters.  But, you are alive and so I rejoice...}{}{3}{}{}
{10}{How did you know where to find us?}{}{5}{}{16}{}
{11}{How you know we here?}{}{-4}{}{16}{}
{16}{I'd heard that Virgil was back in Caladon, alone.  I feared the worst, as I knew a little more about his past than you did.  I've been searching for him for the past week, and only now did I find him.  You've changed much, young Virgil...}{I'd heard that Virgil was back in Caladon, alone.  I feared the worst, as I knew a little more about his past than you did.  I've been searching for him for the past week, and only now did I find him.  You've changed much, young Virgil...}{}{4}{}{}
{17}{[Listen.]}{}{1}{}{-3}{}
{20}{I knew from the moment I saw you that you were special somehow, that you were meant for more than the life you left behind.  And I see that I was right...the Living One couldn't have chosen a better companion.  You will be a powerful ally in the battle to come...}{I knew from the moment I saw you that you were special somehow, that you were meant for more than the life you left behind.  And I see that I was right...the Living One couldn't have chosen a better companion.  You will be a powerful ally in the battle to come...}{}{5}{}{}
{21}{What have YOU been doing, Joachim?}{}{5}{}{24}{}
{22}{Whut you been doin' Joachim?}{}{-4}{}{24}{}
{24}{Well, since I left Stillwater, I've been trying to find out if the prophecies say anymore about what it is you're supposed to be doing.  Unless I've missed something, Arronax hasn't yet returned.  What have YOU found out?}{Well, since I left Stillwater, I've been trying to find out if the prophecies say anymore about what it is you're supposed to be doing.  Unless I've missed something, Arronax hasn't yet returned.  What have YOU found out?}{}{6}{}{}
{25}{[Tell him.]}{}{1}{}{28}{}
{28}{Ah.  That's quite a tale.  You've done very well, and I think your journey is approaching the end.}{Ah.  That's quite a tale.  You've done very well, and I think your journey is approaching the end.}{}{7}{}{}
{29}{I hope so.  Are you coming with us, Joachim?}{}{5}{}{32}{}
{30}{Good!  You wanna come with us, Joachim?}{}{-4}{}{32}{}
{32}{No...I think that you're in capable hands.  [He smiles at Virgil.]  I am no longer needed here, but I'm sure I can find something to keep me busy.  Good luck.  May the spirit of Nasrudin be with you and guide your path.  Farewell...}{No...I think that you're in capable hands.  [He smiles at Virgil.]  I am no longer needed here, but I'm sure I can find something to keep me busy.  Good luck.  May the spirit of Nasrudin be with you and guide your path.  Farewell...}{}{8}{}{}
