{50}{Ah!  I see!  You have killed me, Living One.  I do not...ugggh!  But it hurts!...I do not understand why you have done this.  I was only here to help you...to guide you...and still you have become evil!}{Ah!  I see!  You have killed me, Living One.  I do not...ugggh!  But it hurts!...I do not understand why you have done this.  I was only here to help you...to guide you...and still you have become evil!}{}{10}{}{}
